    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Paxos Snapshot Manager (Phase 2.1)</para>
<para>Manages creation, storage, and restoration of Paxos snapshots.</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Periodic snapshot creation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ZSTD snapshot compression (compression_level 3, target &gt;3× ratio)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Snapshot transfer to new replicas</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic old snapshot cleanup </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
